something doesn't appear to be 'right' near the top or bottom of the map
(ie. stairs missing, wall blocking a path, etc), please let me know.

Right now the patched version is active on sporkhack.com; i expect
nethack.alt.org to activate this patch shortly as well.  Sorry for the
issues; I think we were able to recover all games, but it shouldn't even
